&lt;img alt="0102010_008.png" src="images/0102010_008.png" style="height: 471.93px; width: 613.33px"/&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 36px; text-align: left"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
